WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.160
- When Machine Gun Kelly was here,

00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:01.993
(Nick coughs)

00:00:01.993 --> 00:00:03.017
he said he was a huge fan of you.

00:00:03.017 --> 00:00:05.566
And he also had this to say,
so we wanted to show you.

00:00:05.566 --> 00:00:06.916
- I went to a Backstreet Boys concert,

00:00:06.916 --> 00:00:08.499
and I threw up on the first song

00:00:08.499 --> 00:00:10.076
because the girls were so loud.

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:11.432
They were screaming so loud.

00:00:11.432 --> 00:00:13.348
I don't know how that equaled
out to me throwing up but.

00:00:13.348 --> 00:00:14.181
(audience laughing)

00:00:14.181 --> 00:00:15.272
- It's overwhelming.

00:00:15.272 --> 00:00:16.189
- I know, it happened though.

00:00:16.189 --> 00:00:18.348
Like they came down on these hover boards,

00:00:18.348 --> 00:00:21.015
and everyone was going so crazy.

00:00:22.114 --> 00:00:23.031
I was going

00:00:24.155 --> 00:00:24.988
- [Kelly] Oh!

00:00:24.988 --> 00:00:25.984
(audience laughing)

00:00:25.984 --> 00:00:27.192
(all laughing)

00:00:27.192 --> 00:00:28.497
- [Kelly] They're intense,

00:00:28.497 --> 00:00:29.330
They're intense.

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:30.163
They're loud.

00:00:30.163 --> 00:00:30.996
(audience applauding)

00:00:30.996 --> 00:00:31.829
- [AJ] Well fortunately,

00:00:31.829 --> 00:00:32.662
- [Brian] That's an awesome story.

00:00:32.662 --> 00:00:33.495
so that wasn't why he threw
up, so that's a good thing.

00:00:33.495 --> 00:00:34.328
- [Kelly] No, no.

00:00:34.328 --> 00:00:35.161
(all laughing)

00:00:35.161 --> 00:00:35.994
- That's a good thing.

00:00:35.994 --> 00:00:36.827
- [Brian] Yeah, it's a good thing.

00:00:36.827 --> 00:00:37.660
- It's overwhelming.

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:38.493
- I just wonder if he
made it through the show.

00:00:38.493 --> 00:00:39.326
- No, he did.

00:00:39.326 --> 00:00:40.159
We talked about it.

00:00:40.159 --> 00:00:40.992
No, he loved it.

00:00:40.992 --> 00:00:43.092
But my point though is
like, it's a different vibe,

00:00:43.092 --> 00:00:43.925
especially with boy bands, like,

00:00:43.925 --> 00:00:46.936
it's a different ballgame, the fans.

00:00:46.936 --> 00:00:47.769
- It is. Yeah.

00:00:47.769 --> 00:00:49.455
- [Kelly] Coz I've had
friends that actually work on,

00:00:49.455 --> 00:00:51.088
like y'alls tour, other people's tour,

00:00:51.088 --> 00:00:51.921
do things like backstage.

00:00:51.921 --> 00:00:53.252
Like meet and greet things and all.

00:00:53.252 --> 00:00:54.813
And it's like a different kind of fandom.

00:00:54.813 --> 00:00:56.373
Like they really are invested

00:00:56.373 --> 00:00:57.717
like from a young age, and it's loud.

00:00:57.717 --> 00:00:58.550
- (Kevin) It's loud.

00:00:58.550 --> 00:00:59.383
- (Howie) Yeah.

00:00:59.383 --> 00:01:00.216
(audience cheering)

00:01:00.216 --> 00:01:01.240
- We like to say we have,

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:02.922
(audience cheering)

00:01:02.922 --> 00:01:04.005
- [Nick] We missed that

00:01:04.005 --> 00:01:04.969
- [Kelly] It's like a different frequency.

00:01:04.969 --> 00:01:05.802
- [AJ] What?

00:01:05.802 --> 00:01:06.635
- [Nick] We miss that.

00:01:06.635 --> 00:01:07.468
- What?

00:01:07.468 --> 00:01:08.301
We miss that.

00:01:08.301 --> 00:01:09.134
It's been two years since the tour.

00:01:09.134 --> 00:01:09.967
- I'm not hearing that.

00:01:09.967 --> 00:01:10.897
- What'd you say?

00:01:10.897 --> 00:01:12.783
- [Kelly] I know, but that's
the thing for a lot of artists.

00:01:12.783 --> 00:01:13.881
Like everybody hasn't been able to do

00:01:13.881 --> 00:01:15.152
what they really wanted to do.

00:01:15.152 --> 00:01:16.821
So you're all excited
about doing this tour?

00:01:16.821 --> 00:01:18.190
- (all together) Oh yeah, oh yeah.

00:01:18.190 --> 00:01:19.023
- It's time.

00:01:19.023 --> 00:01:19.856
- Excited to get back out to the fans.

00:01:19.856 --> 00:01:20.689
- Yeah.

00:01:20.689 --> 00:01:22.355
- It's, we've been chopping at the bit.

00:01:22.355 --> 00:01:23.188
(laughing)

00:01:23.188 --> 00:01:24.021
- Yeah.

00:01:24.021 --> 00:01:25.444
- Just sitting at home, eating

00:01:25.444 --> 00:01:26.277
(audience laughing)

00:01:26.277 --> 00:01:27.235
begging to go out.

00:01:27.235 --> 00:01:28.068
(inaudible conversation)

00:01:28.068 --> 00:01:28.901
(all laughing)

00:01:28.901 --> 00:01:30.583
- [Nick] And honestly, I
feel like now especially

00:01:30.583 --> 00:01:31.422
with the way everything is in the world,

00:01:31.422 --> 00:01:32.999
it's like entertainment
is so needed right now.

00:01:32.999 --> 00:01:33.832
- [Kelly] Oh yeah.

00:01:33.832 --> 00:01:34.665
- Like our job is so important.

00:01:34.665 --> 00:01:35.498
- [Kelly] Yeah yeah yeah.

00:01:35.498 --> 00:01:36.331
(audience clapping and cheering)

00:01:36.331 --> 00:01:37.164
- [AJ] Music! music's important.

00:01:37.164 --> 00:01:38.333
- Get people's mind off
the stuff out there.

00:01:38.333 --> 00:01:39.166
(audience cheering)

00:01:39.166 --> 00:01:40.036
- And it's to be in a room and,

00:01:40.036 --> 00:01:41.446
when people that you don't know

00:01:41.446 --> 00:01:42.837
and you're all like vibing on one thing,

00:01:42.837 --> 00:01:43.998
I love that feeling so.

00:01:43.998 --> 00:01:45.133
- [Nick] Yeah.

00:01:45.133 --> 00:01:45.966
- Different kind of energy.

00:01:45.966 --> 00:01:47.344
And we thrive on that energy, you know?

00:01:47.344 --> 00:01:48.264
- [Kelly] Absolutely.

00:01:48.264 --> 00:01:50.726
- I mean, don't get me
wrong, our kids were so happy

00:01:50.726 --> 00:01:52.992
that we were home for this last two years

00:01:52.992 --> 00:01:53.825
- [Kelly] Were your wives?

00:01:53.825 --> 00:01:54.658
- [Nick] Our wives are glad,
our wives were glad we're not

00:01:54.658 --> 00:01:55.491
at the house.

00:01:55.491 --> 00:01:56.524
- [AJ] Our wives are like,

00:01:56.524 --> 00:01:57.357
"you have to go back to work.

00:01:57.357 --> 00:01:58.648
Please go back to work."

00:01:58.648 --> 00:01:59.481
- I had two babies born during that time.

00:01:59.481 --> 00:02:00.314
[AJ] Yes.

00:02:00.314 --> 00:02:01.147
(audience cheering)

00:02:01.147 --> 00:02:02.094
- [Kelly] Oh, that's so cool.

00:02:02.094 --> 00:02:02.927
I'm happy for you.

